956	    // Manual chapter nav (floating-pill buttons + keyboard arrows). These
957	    // dispatch a window event instead of phx-click="next_chapter" while
958	    // the audio player is mounted so we can do a same-<audio>-element src
959	    // swap instead of letting the server's push_patch leave us playing
960	    // the previous chapter. When the next/prev chapter has no audio yet,
961	    // goTo*Chapter returns false and we fall back to the server-owned
962	    // path so the user can still navigate to audio-less chapters.
